abstract: >-
  Design-judgment skill for placing typed probabilistic judgment
  (the Jev-class of System One / decision models) using mathematical,
  logical, and algorithmic mental models. TypeSafe Jev is the
  documented exemplar, not the monopoly. Formal methods are one pillar.
  Not a TypeSafe product.
